Dialogue: 39,0:00:03.36,0:00:06.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget those days.
Dialogue: 39,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,First year of middle school,\N beginning of summer.
Dialogue: 39,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,On my way home.
Dialogue: 39,0:00:17.85,0:00:18.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A passing shower.
Dialogue: 39,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really came out of nowhere, didn't it? {or without the "didn't it"}
Dialogue: 39,0:01:19.19,0:01:20.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
