Dialogue: 39,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-kun, going to the festival?
Dialogue: 39,0:02:03.71,0:02:07.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wonder if Yumi-chan's going. \NI'd better ask her later.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:14.01,0:02:16.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here, use this.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:17.85,0:02:18.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wipe your hair.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold otherwise. {this line swap thing is kind of jolting}
Dialogue: 39,0:02:24.25,0:02:26.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is this your gym shirt?
Dialogue: 39,0:02:26.03,0:02:29.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's clean. Never really used it.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just once.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:31.36,0:02:34.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?! So you {\i1}have{\i0} used it!
Dialogue: 39,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Fine then! Have it your way.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:49.26,0:02:50.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:00.17,0:03:03.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-kun was in the class next to mine.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:04.16,0:03:09.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He was short, and his voice wasn't very deep. Almost like a girl.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:13.77,0:03:15.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you going to the summer festival?
Dialogue: 39,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have you already made plans with your friends?
Dialogue: 39,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 39,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seven o'clock.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:27.87,0:03:30.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,By the clock in Triangle Park.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:40.32,0:03:44.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you and Tanaka? You dating or something?
Dialogue: 39,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,C'mon, spill it!
Dialogue: 39,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 39,0:03:48.89,0:03:51.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,This is why I hate boys.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:51.99,0:03:53.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Boys should just...
Dialogue: 39,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...all die in a fire!
Dialogue: 39,0:04:11.34,0:04:15.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seven o'clock, by the clock in Triangle Park.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:15.94,0:04:19.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The minutes passed by with no sign of Tanaka-kun.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:21.08,0:04:24.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Tanaka's gone?
Dialogue: 39,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard he moved away during summer vacation.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:26.94,0:04:28.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Could've at least told me.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, you didn't know either?
Dialogue: 39,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He was as awkward as they came,
Dialogue: 39,0:04:36.06,0:04:36.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,indecisive,
Dialogue: 39,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and never sure of his place.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:46.63,0:04:50.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I was still in love with Tanaka-kun.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:51.90,0:04:55.89,AoHaru,,0,0,15,,Even now, a small part of my heart belongs to him.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I think,
Dialogue: 39,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,"I want to go back to those days."
Dialogue: 39,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Three years have passed.
Dialogue: 39,0:05:19.71,0:05:22.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I, Yoshioka Futaba,
Dialogue: 39,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,live a peaceful life...
Dialogue: 39,0:05:29.18,0:05:32.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mom! Why didn't you wake me?!
Dialogue: 39,0:05:34.14,0:05:36.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm about to start the third semester of my first year of high school. {your line made it sound like a metaphorical semester}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 39,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba, morning.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yo! Morning, Chie-chan!
Dialogue: 39,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here. Thanks for lending it to me.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No prob.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Girl, you gotta take better care of yourself.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:12.76,0:06:14.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're seriously lacking in allure.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:15.68,0:06:18.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Don't think I don't know any better.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:18.23,0:06:19.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This is all on purpose.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless, Futaba.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But that's what I like about Futaba! {talking to Chie referring to Futaba }
Dialogue: 39,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yo! Morning, Asumi! {low-joshiryoku speak in loud!}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:29.49,0:06:31.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're nothing like {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita, good morning.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:35.37,0:06:36.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:38.16,0:06:41.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Look at 'em slobbering all over her.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:41.00,0:06:44.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's not even all that pretty, either.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They just like the {\i1}idea{\i0} of her. {ok, what I'm trying to do here is convey the idea that they like her ideal, the quiet and subservient girl, in a short like that a bitch would say}{I really like this line}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Makita Yuuri. Is she fine with the way things are?
Dialogue: 39,0:06:51.97,0:06:56.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All the girls in class hate and ostracize her.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.64,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just looking at her pisses me off.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to take it.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.81,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She acts all cutesy in front of the boys.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:59.10,0:07:01.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That was my life the last two years of middle school.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:59.81,0:07:03.27,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right? Just because she's a {\i1\an8}little{\i} pretty...
Dialogue: 39,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.44,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,She's the worst. {man, is this too far? I'm trying to be looser with translation now\an8} {yes, and though I made it a lot tighter, it could also be like, any of a billion other similar things}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be alone. {this should match tenses with the next line, either way}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,So I made my decision.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:07.94,0:07:12.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,With the clean slate I received at high school, I remade myself as a brand-new Futaba!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:12.20,0:07:16.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wanted the girls to like me, so I took all the allure I had and killed it, killed it,
Dialogue: 39,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,killed it!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:18.08,0:07:21.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm starving! Let's go eat already! {I do not know if this is right} {the typical punctuation is "a-grumbling" but I don't think it fits here anyway}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You sure love stuffing yourself.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You blow my mind every day, Futaba.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Want some gum?
Dialogue: 39,0:07:37.39,0:07:40.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, I told you to call me "Sensei"!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So you want some or not? {who does this?}{saa}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:42.81,0:07:43.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Give it.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:45.40,0:07:48.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's this I smell? Love?
Dialogue: 39,0:07:48.40,0:07:48.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:48.99,0:07:54.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're not fooling anyone! You've never shown any interest in guys, and now you're going gaga over Tanaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on! I don't...
Dialogue: 39,0:07:57.03,0:08:01.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We're just kidding. Love and you mix like oil and water. {there's definitely an idiom like "that suits you like xxx on xxx" in a negative way} {I'm sure you could make one up that sounds okay}
Dialogue: 39,0:08:02.21,0:08:04.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, never in a million years.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:07.55,0:08:11.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Dude, don't you think Yoshioka \Nfrom Class 2's kinda cute? {I like it better when they name their classes after letters; this capitalization thing is awkward}
Dialogue: 39,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.93,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No, stop it!
Dialogue: 39,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess, but isn't she...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:15.72,beefbun,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\1c&H181C2F&\bord0.4\frz333.1\pos(978.858,633.714)}Bulky Beef Bun
