Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.10,0:08:16.39,beefbun,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\frz18.49\pos(586.857,226.143)}Bulky Beef Bun
Dialogue: 39,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 39,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:20.81,0:08:22.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, never mind.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you hear those guys?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:27.11,0:08:32.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba, I be you'd be drowning in boys if you cleaned up a bit.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:32.32,0:08:35.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Please, like I care about that. {this feels kinda pls-y}
Dialogue: 39,0:08:35.57,0:08:37.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know I hate guys.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:38.41,0:08:41.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,As long as I've got you two, guys can all just—
Dialogue: 39,0:08:51.13,0:08:52.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What unflattering bread.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:03.10,0:09:05.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:09:09.94,0:09:11.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba, let's go.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:12.11,0:09:14.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's something I forgot to buy.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:14.90,0:09:15.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 39,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:22.58,0:09:26.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His voice and height are completely different...
Dialogue: 39,0:09:28.08,0:09:29.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see his face...
Dialogue: 39,0:09:31.00,0:09:35.17,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why am I so convinced that he's Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi!
Dialogue: 39,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi, buying lunch now?
Dialogue: 39,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,"Mabuchi"?
Dialogue: 39,0:10:07.67,0:10:09.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll tag along.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:19.51,0:10:20.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It wasn't him.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:24.85,0:10:28.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Good thing I didn't try to talk to him.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:30.02,0:10:34.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Though the fake Tanaka-kun did smirk when our eyes met.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:36.11,0:10:40.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,And judging from his blue shoes, he's a first-year like me.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't believe myself.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why would I even think he was Tanaka-kun? {as opposed to contracted "did"}
Dialogue: 39,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 39,0:10:59.43,0:11:03.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not following you or anything! \NWe just happen to be going the same way!
Dialogue: 39,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I-I messed up.
Dialogue: 39,0:11:20.49,0:11:25.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm not following him.\N I just happen to live this way.
Dialogue: 39,0:11:28.37,0:11:30.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Huh? Just a minute here...
Dialogue: 39,0:11:30.54,0:11:34.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he live in the same neighborhood as me? {I was sort of hesitant about yours because there're a few levels of logic you'd need to go through but it's also fine}
Dialogue: 39,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Really came out of nowhere, didn't it?
Dialogue: 39,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 39,0:12:03.11,0:12:04.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 39,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 39,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ta... Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:12:20.71,0:12:22.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My name's Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 39,0:12:28.64,0:12:31.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I thought you were someone else.
Dialogue: 39,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really came out of nowhere, didn't it?
Dialogue: 39,0:12:59.34,0:13:01.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are{\i0} Tanaka-kun!
Dialogue: 39,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, not anymore.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm Mabuchi Kou now.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:08.26,0:13:11.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,After my parents divorced,
Dialogue: 39,0:13:11.64,0:13:13.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,my name changed.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:15.19,0:13:16.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His voice, his height,
Dialogue: 39,0:13:17.77,0:13:19.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and even his name have changed.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 39,0:13:22.23,0:13:25.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The person before my eyes right now
Dialogue: 39,0:13:26.41,0:13:30.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,is the first boy I ever loved.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:32.49,0:13:38.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You didn't realize who I was for two whole semesters.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd get it eventually,
Dialogue: 39,0:13:41.30,0:13:43.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but I didn't expect it to take this long.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're a riot.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:47.05,0:13:48.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Is this how these things usually go?
Dialogue: 39,0:13:49.30,0:13:53.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I recognized you right away, \Neven with how you turned out.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you implying?!
Dialogue: 39,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're certainly not the quiet girl I used to know. {I guess English doesn't have a positive adjective for this}
Dialogue: 39,0:13:59.06,0:14:03.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-If you knew, you should've said something sooner!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And you've changed just as much as me, Tanaka-kun!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:05.69,0:14:08.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm not Tanaka anymore.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My damn name's Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:11.12,0:14:14.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Geez... have I ever met such a scary person?
Dialogue: 39,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Not like I'm one to talk...
Dialogue: 39,0:14:17.41,0:14:19.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, putting that aside,
Dialogue: 39,0:14:19.58,0:14:22.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,wanna go for a reunion hug?
Dialogue: 39,0:14:22.54,0:14:23.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come. {picked from the multitude of "come", "get over here" "Come to papa" and "get that fine little ass into my hands"} {My alternate is "come hither"}
Dialogue: 39,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No! Who even thinks of that?!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:29.39,0:14:31.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "come"?!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:33.06,0:14:37.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've always had it out for guys.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:38.14,0:14:39.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess that hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:40.31,0:14:43.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Boys should just all die in a fire!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hate them.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:49.61,0:14:51.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Always have.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:51.95,0:14:52.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:15:00.71,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kudarizaka fumikiri made
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:15:00.71,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Before I knew it, I had run
Dialogue: 39,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're an exception.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:59.67,0:15:02.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I never got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:05.71,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}atashi wa muchuu de hashitta
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:05.71,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}all the way down to the train tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:11.39,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kono koi wo saegiru you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:11.39,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}What I found was a train departing,
Dialogue: 39,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So that's... how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:16.27,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}densha wa sugisatta
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:16.27,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}taking my love with it.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:21.94,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}tooi hi no kioku  umi no kagayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:21.94,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Distant memories, shining seas.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:21.10,0:15:23.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I... really did...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.82,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kisetsu wa meguru
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.82,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Seasons pass.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:24.77,0:15:25.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:29.19,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:29.19,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Now, I squint up at the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:34.58,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}chiisaku yureta himawari
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:34.58,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}A sunflower swayed in the breeze,
Dialogue: 39,0:15:30.70,0:15:33.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This feels just like those days I've longed for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:40.96,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}sayonara mo ienai mata
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:40.96,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:38.41,0:15:39.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:50.80,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:50.80,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We can never go back. {english doesn't make sense, does this need a "to"} {it's awkward because you usually don't use "return" here}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:56.35,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:56.35,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}If only the summer fireworks
Dialogue: 39,0:15:55.55,0:15:58.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Things have changed since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:16:02.27,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}namida no saki ni utsureba
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:16:02.27,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}had appeared before my tears...
Dialogue: 39,0:15:58.02,0:16:00.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Both for you and for me.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:02.27,0:16:05.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's all in the past now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:07.69,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will kitto omoidasu wa
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:07.69,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will definitely remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:19.45,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:19.45,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:10.19,0:16:14.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This must be his way of telling me to forget about it.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:16.95,0:16:20.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't cry on me now.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:25.21,0:16:29.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But even as he spoke such uncaring words,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:33.97,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}chiisaku yureta himawari
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:33.97,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}A sunflower swayed in the breeze.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:29.55,0:16:32.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I heard a tinge of sadness in his voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:40.31,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}ano hi no mama no atashi wa
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:40.31,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Back then, I couldn't even
Dialogue: 39,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Or at least I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:45.06,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}nobita maegami mo mitometaku nai
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:45.06,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}accept seeing my bangs grow.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:45.06,0:16:48.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Back then, I didn't know. {it's not really thoughts racing, just things that she uh, thought (same word, but it's not the same)}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:51.99,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}nani mo kawattenai
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:51.99,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.66,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I thought that I'd be able to talk it out with Tanaka-kun after summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:57.87,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kaze no oto ni furikaeru
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:57.87,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Hearing something, I look behind me,
Dialogue: 39,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I thought there'd be plenty of chances to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:04.29,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kyou mo mata mitsukerarenai
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:04.29,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}but it turns out it was just the wind again.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:09.59,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will sotto negatte miru
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:09.59,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will make a wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:21.68,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:21.68,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}that you'll realize that I am here, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We can never go back.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Things have changed since then.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why does this bother me so much?!{"What is this stupid feeling in my chest" reads like a literal translation, but it isn't one...}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:29.57,shop,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\bord0.7\fax.08\fs46\frx-1\frz354.2\pos(637.207,491.635)}S{*\fax0.082}c{*\fax0.084}h{*\fax0.086}o{*\fax0.088}o{*\fax0.09}l {*\fax0.094}S{*\fax0.096}h{*\fax0.098}o{\fax.1}p
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.60,0:17:29.57,shop,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fax.08\fs46\frx-1\frz354.2\pos(637.207,491.635)}S{*\fax0.082}c{*\fax0.084}h{*\fax0.086}o{*\fax0.088}o{*\fax0.09}l {*\fax0.094}S{*\fax0.096}h{*\fax0.098}o{\fax.1}p
Dialogue: 39,0:17:27.60,0:17:28.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 39,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 39,0:17:29.57,0:17:33.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A sweet bean bun, a croquet, and a Danish! {they should either all be arthrous or all be anarthrous}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That again? {retimed, not counting the sigh as part of the next line}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can you even eat all that? {disguster}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I know, right? Doesn't it disgust you?
Dialogue: 39,0:17:42.79,0:17:45.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who cares? It's my choice.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:46.67,0:17:50.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The only reason I overeat is to lower my allure...
Dialogue: 39,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.50,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...but I can't say that out loud. {if you can't tell by now, this is my preferred ellipsis style}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:53.05,0:17:54.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm so despicable! {shameful girl, or you choice of adjectives}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, these please.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:57.30,0:17:58.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll take this.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure, just a sec.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:01.56,0:18:04.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm all out of bags.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:04.22,0:18:06.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Give me a minute and I'll bring more out.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:06.52,0:18:08.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:10.44,0:18:12.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That'll be 530 yen.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:13.28,0:18:15.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good, exact change.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Where's Chie-chan...
Dialogue: 39,0:18:18.45,0:18:20.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:21.07,0:18:24.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get away without paying?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? But I did pay.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:27.46,0:18:31.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't get smart with me. Those aren't in a bag.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.00,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Huh? Futaba?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 39,0:18:33.67,0:18:36.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that. I see you students do this left and right.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 39,0:18:38.09,0:18:39.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Asumi, Chie-chan.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:41.64,0:18:45.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, Futaba? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:45.97,0:18:46.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You gotta pay like everyone else.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I did!
Dialogue: 39,0:18:50.85,0:18:53.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Pay now and I won't have to tell the teachers about this.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:53.44,0:18:55.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you'd just listen...
Dialogue: 39,0:18:55.03,0:18:57.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She already paid.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:01.70,0:19:02.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She already paid, right?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:07.00,0:19:10.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's good to go.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:10.21,0:19:13.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really? You should've said something sooner.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:13.67,0:19:17.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whatever... you can go now.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 39,0:19:19.51,0:19:22.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Apologize, old hag.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,"Hag"?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:26.22,0:19:29.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You messed up. You apologize. {music direction has been great this entire scene} {AYAMARE}
Dialogue: 39,0:19:31.56,0:19:33.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}so{\i0} sorry.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:34.02,0:19:36.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah... sure.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey! Futaba?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:49.41,0:19:51.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-kun, wait up!
Dialogue: 39,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You really helped me out there.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's the one who's got a few screws loose.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:08.60,0:20:11.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was about to snap.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:13.69,0:20:18.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I felt better after you stood up for me. {what's what is usually ... not used this way}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's all it took to make you feel better?
Dialogue: 39,0:20:22.82,0:20:24.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're so shallow. {this is kind of ughy}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And it's because you're like that\Nthat your friendships are shallow.{hopefully a comma and a newline will obscure the double-that}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:31.50,0:20:34.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's like you're all just pretending to be friends.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:36.54,0:20:37.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's pointless. {bringing it back}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It might look pointless to you,
Dialogue: 39,0:20:46.43,0:20:49.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but it's all very important to me!
Dialogue: 39,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What? Just drop it.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I couldn't really care less.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:54.31,0:20:56.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's your business.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:58.06,0:21:02.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,First he saves me, and then brushes me off.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I just don't get him.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:05.86,0:21:09.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Is he really the Tanaka-kun I once knew?
Dialogue: 39,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, and also...
Dialogue: 39,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My name's Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:24.93,0:21:27.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka Kou is long gone.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:37.48,0:21:41.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Just as I've changed, the Tanaka-kun from my memories...
Dialogue: 39,0:21:42.57,0:21:43.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...no longer exists.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:47.03,0:21:48.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't go back...
Dialogue: 39,0:21:51.41,0:21:52.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...to those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HDFB045&\bord3\blur3\3c&HE3C33B&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\c&HFFFEF9&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
Dialogue: 39,0:23:34.55,0:23:36.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why're you all by yourself?
Dialogue: 39,0:23:36.39,0:23:38.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What happened to those friends of yours?
